# Git keeps everything this project is made of: source, pages, tests, knowledge/, the Claude
# config and the rules. Only four kinds of thing stay out — see knowledge/ops-deploy-files.md.
#
# What the CONTAINER holds is a different question, answered by render/Dockerfile and .dockerignore.

# ── 1. SECRETS. Never remove a line from this block. ─────────────────────────
# A committed .env is a live database, a Cloudflare account and the admin gate handed to anyone
# who clones the repo, and rewriting history does not un-leak it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# ── 2. Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.bin/

# ── 3. Generated, rebuilt on demand ──────────────────────────────────────────
public/styles/output.css
server-rs/target/
router/dist/
dist/
.wrangler/

# ── 4. Machine noise and local dumps ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*_backup_*.json
